ngshu-030","work_id":"w-liangshu","source_id":"s-liang030-ws1508510"},{"text":"梁天監初，尚書僕射范雲嘉其至行，將表奏之，會雲卒不果。樂安任昉有盛名，為後進所慕，遊其門者，昉必推薦。子野於昉為從中表，獨不至，昉亦恨焉，故不之善。","source_position":{"start":10302,"end":10376,"raw":"梁天監初，尚書僕射范雲嘉其至行，將表奏之，會雲卒不果。樂安任昉有盛名，為後進所慕，遊其門者，昉必推薦。子野於昉為從中表，獨不至，昉亦恨焉，故不之善。","raw_path":"sources/nanshi/wikisource-1554233-raw.wikitext"},"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p015","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p015:m0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"范雲","kind":"person","person_id":"nln_ldz_i3j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"天監初尚書僕射欲表子野行、適卒；梁030同官、同傳主推薦未果事件。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p015:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"hvz_7p7_g9m","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p015:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"之","kind":"person","person_id":"hvz_7p7_g9m","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p015:m0022","start":22,"end":23,"surface":"雲","kind":"person","person_id":"nln_ldz_i3j","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"天監初尚書僕射欲表子野行、適卒；梁030同官、同傳主推薦未果事件。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p015:m0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"任昉","kind":"person","person_id":"tvc_q3c_t7w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子野不至任昉門、昉恨之，梁030同人不悅子野的交遊事件；從中表原詞不化成具體母系鏈。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p015:m0046","start":46,"end":47,"surface":"昉","kind":"person","person_id":"tvc_q3c_t7w","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子野不至任昉門、昉恨之，梁030同人不悅子野的交遊事件；從中表原詞不化成具體母系鏈。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p015:m0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"hvz_7p7_g9m","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p015:m0